      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-weight: 600;">Environment Portability</td>
        <td>Primarily JSON/Web environments.</td>
        <td>Linked-data formats (Turtle, JSON-LD).</td>
        <td>Multi-environment storage bindings (Python, Rust, TS, SQL).</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-weight: 600;">Agent Interaction</td>
        <td>None (requires custom code).</td>
